 0  allow  fs__write_file                  always-allow-writes           writes are explicitly allowed by this policy
 1  allow  fs__write_file                  always-allow-writes           writes are explicitly allowed by this policy
 2  deny   fs__write_file                  budget                        budget: limit of 2 calls for fs.write_file reached
 3  allow  fs__read_file                   -                             default allow
 4  deny   fs__read_file                   budget                        budget: session limit of 3 calls reached
